{"title":"Career Roadmap · RegTech Analyst","role":"RegTech Analyst","summary":"A RegTech Analyst uses technology, data and financial-domain knowledge to help banks, FinTech companies, insurers and other regulated organisations meet regulatory and compliance requirements efficiently.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – FinTech / Digital Finance"},"about":[{"label":"Degree–Career Alignment","text":"Very Strong"},{"label":"Primary Domains","text":"Regulatory Technology, FinTech, Compliance, Risk, AML/KYC, Data Analytics"},{"label":"Typical Entry Level","text":"RegTech Analyst / Compliance Analyst / AML-KYC Analyst / Risk & Compliance Analyst"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"What does a RegTech Analyst do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A RegTech Analyst uses technology, data and financial-domain knowledge to help banks, FinTech companies, insurers and other regulated organisations meet regulatory and compliance requirements efficiently."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitoring regulatory requirements and compliance obligations"},{"text":"Analysing KYC/AML and transaction data"},{"text":"Supporting transaction monitoring systems"},{"text":"Identifying suspicious patterns and potential compliance risks"},{"text":"Preparing regulatory reports"},{"text":"Maintaining compliance rules and workflows"},{"text":"Testing compliance technology and alerts"},{"text":"Investigating false positives"},{"text":"Supporting regulatory audits"},{"text":"Working with APIs, databases and compliance platforms"},{"text":"Automating repetitive compliance processes"},{"text":"Using analytics/AI to improve risk detection"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important positioning","text":"RegTech is an interdisciplinary career. A B.Com FinTech graduate has a strong foundation, but employability improves substantially by adding AML/KYC, regulatory knowledge, SQL, Python, data analytics and compliance technology."}]},{"heading":"Career Development Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Commerce + banking + digital finance"}],[{"text":"Technical foundation"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"SQL, Excel, Python, databases"}],[{"text":"Compliance specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"KYC, AML, sanctions, transaction monitoring"}],[{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"RegTech projects + internships"}],[{"text":"First job"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Compliance/AML/RegTech Analyst"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"AML Analytics / RegTech / Risk Technology"}],[{"text":"Senior level"},{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior RegTech / Compliance Technology"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"8–12+ years"},{"text":"RegTech Manager / Compliance Technology Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What You Need to Learn During B.Com","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Commerce + Financial Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Build the business foundation first."},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Corporate Accounting"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial Management"},{"text":"Banking fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"UPI"},{"text":"Cards"},{"text":"Internet banking"},{"text":"Mobile banking"},{"text":"Digital lending"},{"text":"Neobanks"},{"text":"Payment gateways"},{"text":"Wallets"},{"text":"Open banking"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Digital identity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Basic databases"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Goal","text":"Understand how financial transactions move through digital systems."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Data + Compliance Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the career starts becoming specialised."},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory & Compliance Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"Customer Due Diligence (CDD)"},{"text":"Enhanced Due Diligence (EDD)"},{"text":"AML"},{"text":"Counter-Terrorist Financing concepts"},{"text":"Sanctions screening"},{"text":"Beneficial ownership"},{"text":"Customer risk scoring"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Suspicious transaction concepts"},{"text":"Fraud vs AML"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Compliance risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Basic–Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Basic"}],[{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Basic"}],[{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Intermediate"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — RegTech Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Now move from general compliance to technology-enabled compliance."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the RegTech ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how technology supports:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer onboarding","KYC","risk scoring","transaction monitoring","sanctions screening","alert generation","investigation","reporting","audit"]},{"type":"h","text":"Important concepts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rules engines"},{"text":"Risk engines"},{"text":"Alert management"},{"text":"Case management"},{"text":"Workflow automation"},{"text":"Compliance dashboards"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Identity verification"},{"text":"Document verification"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Entity resolution"},{"text":"Sanctions screening"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Regulatory change management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Industry Readiness"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, you should be capable of analysing a realistic compliance dataset."},{"type":"h","text":"Build these capabilities"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance + Compliance"},{"type":"flow","items":["Banking","Payments","AML/KYC","Risk","Regulatory requirements"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Python","APIs","Databases","Power BI"]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics","Risk scoring","Anomaly detection","Dashboards","Data quality"]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Investigation","Documentation","Report writing","Stakeholder communication"]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Projects are extremely important because RegTech employers want evidence that you can work with financial data + compliance problems."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — AML Transaction Monitoring Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a synthetic transaction dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer ID"},{"text":"Transaction ID"},{"text":"Amount"},{"text":"Country"},{"text":"Merchant"},{"text":"Transaction type"},{"text":"Timestamp"},{"text":"Account age"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python/SQL to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unusually large transactions"},{"text":"High-frequency transactions"},{"text":"Geographic anomalies"},{"text":"Structuring-like patterns"},{"text":"Unusual customer behaviour"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Display results in Power BI."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — KYC Risk Scoring System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a customer risk model using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer type"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Transaction volume"},{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Account age"},{"text":"Transaction frequency"},{"text":"High-risk indicators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Generate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Low Risk / Medium Risk / High Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"and explain why the customer received that score."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sanctions Screening Prototype"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a synthetic customer database and compare names against a synthetic sanctions/watchlist dataset."},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exact matching"},{"text":"Fuzzy matching"},{"text":"Similarity scoring"},{"text":"False positives"},{"text":"Match review"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python + SQL would be ideal."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Regulatory Compliance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KYC completion"},{"text":"Pending reviews"},{"text":"High-risk customers"},{"text":"AML alerts"},{"text":"Alert closure rate"},{"text":"Suspicious transactions"},{"text":"Investigation ageing"},{"text":"Compliance SLA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — AI-Assisted Compliance Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a prototype that uses NLP/LLMs to classify synthetic compliance alerts or extract information from synthetic regulatory documents."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Document","Extraction","Classification","Risk Flag","Human Review"]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"demonstrate human-in-the-loop controls rather than presenting AI as an autonomous compliance decision-maker."}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Skill Development","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Core Focus","Tools / Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Commerce + banking"},{"text":"Accounting, finance, banking, Excel"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"SQL, Python, Power BI, statistics"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"KYC, AML, sanctions, risk"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring, APIs, dashboards, automation, AI"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Employability"},{"text":"3–5 projects + internship + portfolio"}]]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A RegTech Analyst can specialise in several directions."},{"type":"h","text":"A. AML & Transaction Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AML"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Suspicious activity analysis"},{"text":"Alert investigation"},{"text":"Risk scoring"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Best for","text":"banking/FinTech compliance."},{"type":"h","text":"B. KYC & Digital Identity"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital onboarding"},{"text":"Identity verification"},{"text":"Customer due diligence"},{"text":"Document verification"},{"text":"Biometrics"},{"text":"Identity fraud"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C. Compliance Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Risk analytics"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"D. Regulatory Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory data"},{"text":"Reporting systems"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Regulatory submissions"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"E. RegTech Product"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance platforms"},{"text":"Product requirements"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Workflow systems"},{"text":"User requirements"},{"text":"Product analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can eventually lead toward RegTech Product Manager."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Banking, payments, financial products"}],[{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"KYC, AML, CDD, EDD, sanctions"}],[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Customer risk, transaction risk, operational risk"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics, anomaly detection"}],[{"text":"Database"},{"text":"SQL, relational databases"}],[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Python"}],[{"text":"BI"},{"text":"Power BI, Excel"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"APIs, JSON, Git"}],[{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Monitoring, screening, case management"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"ML/NLP/LLM fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Compliance reports, SOPs"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Investigation & stakeholder reporting"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from Year 2/3."},{"type":"h","text":"Target companies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"Insurance companies"},{"text":"NBFCs"},{"text":"Payment companies"},{"text":"Financial technology vendors"},{"text":"Compliance technology companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Risk advisory firms"},{"text":"Big Four advisory practices"},{"text":"AML/KYC service providers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search for these internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RegTech Intern"},{"text":"Compliance Intern"},{"text":"AML Intern"},{"text":"KYC Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Risk Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Financial Crime Intern"},{"text":"Compliance Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"FinTech Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Transaction Monitoring Intern"},{"text":"Regulatory Reporting Intern"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful certifications can strengthen the profile, but projects + internship experience should come first."},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider certifications/training in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AML"},{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"Financial Crime"},{"text":"Sanctions Compliance"},{"text":"Fraud Risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance/FinTech"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Banking technology"},{"text":"Financial risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional certifications such as CAMS can become more valuable once the student has sufficient compliance exposure; verify current eligibility and experience requirements before planning around a certification."}]},{"heading":"First Jobs You Can Target","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct entry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RegTech Analyst"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"AML Analyst"},{"text":"KYC Analyst"},{"text":"AML/KYC Analyst"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Crime Analyst"},{"text":"Transaction Monitoring Analyst"},{"text":"Compliance Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Regulatory Reporting Analyst"},{"text":"Fraud Analyst"},{"text":"Compliance Data Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"FinTech Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Banking Compliance Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After 2–4 years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior RegTech Analyst"},{"text":"Senior AML Analyst"},{"text":"AML Analytics Specialist"},{"text":"Compliance Technology Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Crime Analytics Specialist"},{"text":"Regulatory Technology Consultant"},{"text":"Risk Technology Analyst"},{"text":"Compliance Product Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After 5–8+ years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RegTech Manager"},{"text":"Compliance Technology Manager"},{"text":"AML Analytics Manager"},{"text":"Financial Crime Technology Lead"},{"text":"RegTech Product Manager"},{"text":"Compliance Transformation Manager"},{"text":"Risk Technology Lead"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Strong options"},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Banking & Financial Services"},{"text":"Information Systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Financial Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Financial Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialised programmes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Crime"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Cybersecurity + Financial Crime"},{"text":"Compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technology-heavy RegTech career, MBA FinTech/Business Analytics or an analytics-oriented master's can be particularly useful."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Options","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc FinTech"},{"text":"MSc Financial Technology"},{"text":"MSc Risk Management"},{"text":"MSc Financial Crime"},{"text":"MSc Compliance"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Data Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Financial Data Science"},{"text":"MSc Information Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential study destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Check the current university curriculum, tuition, visa rules and post-study work conditions before applying."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com FinTech","Compliance / AML / KYC Internship","RegTech / AML / Compliance Analyst","RegTech Analyst / AML Analytics Analyst","Senior RegTech Analyst","RegTech / Compliance Technology Specialist","RegTech Manager / Compliance Technology Lead","RegTech Product Manager / Head of RegTech","Chief Compliance Technology / Risk Technology Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"There is also a strong data route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com FinTech","SQL + Python + Compliance","Compliance Data Analyst","AML Analytics Analyst","Financial Crime Data Scientist","AI/Risk Analytics Lead"]}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Evolution of RegTech","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"RegTech is likely to become increasingly data- and AI-driven."},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional RegTech"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rule-based monitoring"},{"text":"Manual investigation"},{"text":"Static risk rules"},{"text":"Spreadsheet reporting"},{"text":"Manual KYC review"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Modern RegTech"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine-learning risk scoring"},{"text":"Behavioural analytics"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Entity resolution"},{"text":"Automated document extraction"},{"text":"Graph analytics"},{"text":"Real-time transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Cloud compliance platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging direction"},{"type":"flow","items":["Transaction Data","Real-Time Monitoring","AI/ML Risk Detection","Alert Prioritisation","Human Investigation","Automated Documentation","Regulatory Reporting"]},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst's role increasingly shifts from manually reviewing everything to designing, validating and interpreting technology-assisted compliance systems."}]},{"heading":"Future Career Opportunities: 2040–2046","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential emerging roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"AI Governance Analyst"},{"text":"Autonomous Compliance Systems Specialist"},{"text":"Financial Crime Data Scientist"},{"text":"RegTech AI Product Manager"},{"text":"Digital Identity Risk Specialist"},{"text":"Real-Time Payments Risk Analyst"},{"text":"AI Model Risk & Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Regulatory AI Auditor"},{"text":"Compliance Automation Architect"},{"text":"Algorithmic Financial Crime Investigator"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The combination of commerce + financial regulation + data + AI should remain valuable because regulated financial institutions will need humans who understand both the business/regulatory context and the technology."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com FinTech student targeting RegTech Analyst, the strongest combination is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Finance","Banking","FinTech"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"flow","items":["KYC","AML","CDD","EDD","Sanctions","Transaction Monitoring"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics","SQL","Power BI","Excel"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","pandas","APIs","JSON"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Databases","Git","Cloud fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"RegTech"},{"type":"flow","items":["Rules engines","Risk scoring","Alert management","Case management","Regulatory reporting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"flow","items":["Machine Learning","NLP","anomaly detection","responsible AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Investigation","documentation","communication","analytical reasoning"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to take a synthetic banking transaction dataset and answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who is high risk, why are they high risk, what transactions triggered the risk, what evidence supports the alert, and how should the case be documented?"},{"type":"p","text":"If the student can answer that using SQL + Python + Power BI + AML/KYC knowledge, they have a substantially stronger RegTech profile than someone who has only completed generic FinTech courses."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com FinTech","Banking & FinTech fundamentals","Advanced Excel","SQL","Python","KYC/AML","Sanctions & Transaction Monitoring","Power BI","Compliance analytics","RegTech projects","Internship","RegTech/AML/Compliance Analyst","AML Analytics/RegTech Specialist","RegTech Manager/Product/Technology Lead"]}]}]}